/Creator ( )
/Producer ( )
/Author (Griffiths,M. P.)
/Keywords (*INPUT OUTPUT PROCESSING;*METHODOLOGY;*COMPILERS;INTEGER PROGRAMMING;FLOATING POINT OPERATION;LIBRARIES;ACCESS;USER NEEDS;CONFIGURATIONS;COMPUTER FILES;UNITED KINGDOM)
/Subject (This memo describes a set of procedures for use with the RCC80 Coral compiler, which enable user programs to access the host operating system and transform integer and floating point numbers to and from ASCII strings and their binary representations. The structure of the library is described, and this shows how the procedures may be easily transported onto a new hardware configuration.)
/Title (A Portable Input/Output Package for Coral Based 8080 Systems,)
/Filename (/pdf/TR/ADA134368.pdf)
>>
